#: ../../../troubleshooting.md:3
msgid "macOS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../troubleshooting.md:5 ../../../troubleshooting.md:75
msgid "Unable to find `urdf_model.h` error"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../troubleshooting.md:7 ../../../troubleshooting.md:77
msgid ""
"After installing all the dependencies and starting the build process, you "
"may encounter an error that looks like this:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../troubleshooting.md:9
msgid ""
"/Users/user/dome_ws/src/sdformat/src/parser_urdf.cc:30:10: fatal error: "
"'urdf_model/model.h' file not found\n"
"#include <urdf_model/model.h>\n"
"         ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
"1 error generated.\n"
"make[2]: *** [src/CMakeFiles/sdformat9.dir/parser_urdf.cc.o] Error 1\n"
"make[1]: *** [src/CMakeFiles/sdformat9.dir/all] Error 2\n"
"make: *** [all] Error 2\n"
"Failed   <<< sdformat9\t[ Exited with code 2 ]\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../troubleshooting.md:20 ../../../troubleshooting.md:90
msgid ""
"First check if `urdfdom` and `urdfdom_headers` are installed by running:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../troubleshooting.md:22 ../../../troubleshooting.md:92
msgid "brew install urdfdom urdfdom_headers\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../troubleshooting.md:26 ../../../troubleshooting.md:96
msgid ""
"Then if the error persists, compile with the internal version of `urdfdom` "
"by running:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../troubleshooting.md:28 ../../../troubleshooting.md:98
msgid "colcon build --cmake-args -DUSE_INTERNAL_URDF=ON --merge-install\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../troubleshooting.md:32 ../../../troubleshooting.md:102
msgid ""
"This command will ignore the system installation of `urdfdom` and use the "
"internal version instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../troubleshooting.md:34 ../../../troubleshooting.md:104
msgid "Unable to load .dylib file"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../troubleshooting.md:36 ../../../troubleshooting.md:106
msgid ""
"When running the `ign gazebo -s` command, an error like the one below may "
"show up:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../troubleshooting.md:38
msgid ""
"Error while loading the library [/Users/dome/dome_ws/install/lib//"
"libignition-physics2-dartsim-plugin.2.dylib]: dlopen(/Users/dome/dome_ws/"
"install/lib//libignition-physics2-dartsim-plugin.2.dylib, 5): Library not "
"loaded: @rpath/libIrrXML.dylib\n"
"  Referenced from: /usr/local/opt/assimp/lib/libassimp.5.dylib\n"
"  Reason: image not found\n"
"[Err] [Physics.cc:275] Unable to load the /Users/dome/dome_ws/install/lib//"
"libignition-physics2-dartsim-plugin.2.dylib library.\n"
"Escalating to SIGKILL on [Gazebo Sim Server]\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../troubleshooting.md:46 ../../../troubleshooting.md:116
msgid ""
"The issue is related to OSX System Integrity Protection(SIP). The workaround "
"is to run `ign` with a different ruby then make sure that ruby is loaded."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../troubleshooting.md:48 ../../../troubleshooting.md:118
msgid ""
"brew install ruby\n"
"\n"
"# Add the following to ~/.bashrc\n"
"export PATH=/usr/local/Cellar/ruby/2.6.5/bin:$PATH\n"
"\n"
"# Source ~/.bashrc in terminal\n"
". ~/.bashrc\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../troubleshooting.md:58
msgid "Ignition libraries are not found"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../troubleshooting.md:60
msgid "If you see this error message:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../troubleshooting.md:62
msgid ""
"I cannot find any available 'ign' command:\n"
"\t* Did you install any ignition library?\n"
"\t* Did you set the IGN_CONFIG_PATH environment variable?\n"
"\t    E.g.: export IGN_CONFIG_PATH=$HOME/local/share/ignition\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../troubleshooting.md:69
msgid ""
"You should set up the environment variable `IGN_CONFIG_PATH=/usr/local/share/"
"ignition/`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../troubleshooting.md:71
msgid ""
"No rule to make target `/usr/lib/libm.dylib', needed by `lib/libignition-"
"physics3-dartsim-plugin.3.1.0.dylib'.  Stop."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../troubleshooting.md:73
msgid ""
"Try to run `brew outdated` followed by a `brew upgrade` may fix some of it."
msgstr ""

